:[{"type":"text","text":"For most elements, any program will compute a default x and y position. The position attributes let this be changed two ways."}]}],"name":"position"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The font attribute group gathers together attributes for determining the font within a credit or direction. They are based on the text styles for Cascading Style Sheets. The font-family is a comma-separated list of font names. The font-style can be normal or italic. The font-size can be one of the CSS sizes or a numeric point size. The font-weight can be normal or bold. The default is application-dependent, but is a text font vs. a music font."}]}],"name":"font"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The color attribute group indicates the color of an element."}]}],"name":"color"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The placement attribute indicates whether something is above or below another element, such as a note or a notation."}]}],"name":"placement"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The smufl attribute group is used to indicate a particular Standard Music Font Layout (SMuFL) character. Sometimes this is a formatting choice, and sometimes this is a refinement of the semantic meaning of an element."}]}],"name":"smufl"}],"kind":"parameters"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlarrow\/init(content:position:font:color:placement:smufl:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLArrow\/init(content:position:font:color:placement:smufl:)"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLArrow"]]},"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"title":"init(content:position:font:color:placement:smufl:)","symbolKind":"init","modules":[{"name":"IvorMXL"}],"